window.products.push({"id":935101,"name":"Mauviel Copper Fish Poacher, 19-5/8 by 5-1/8-Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512q0b6AW-L._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"Dedicated to gourmands who require only the best kitchen equipment, Mauviel's copper fish poacher will make an impression with both its good looks and the deliciousness that it delivers. Measuring 19-5/8 by 5-1/8 inches, this fish poacher is constructed of solid copper--the most efficient conductor of heat used in cookware--and is lined with tin for safe poaching and easy cleaning. The outer surface is hand-hammered for a beautiful finish. It comes with a flat lid with wide brass handle, and the poacher is also complemented by large, rounded brass handles--perfectly sized for gripping with an oven mitt. All handles are firmly affixed with solid copper rivets for durability. Hand washing recommended. Exterior can be cleaned and polished with copper cleanser. Established in 1830 by Ernest Mauviel in Villedieu-les-Poêles, the strength and foundation for Mauviel's manufacturing expertise is based upon the rich 800-year tradition of copper manufacturing this Normandy village known as \"the city of copper.\" Today, Mauviel products are used by many famous chefs and professionals, and its cookware is also designed to meet the needs of the most discerning household cooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512q0b6AW-L._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mauviel","source_asin":"B001KZHERQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001KZHERQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001KZHERQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
