window.products.push({"id":935110,"name":"KitchenCraft KC7PASTRY Double Sided Pastry Cutters Set with Fluted/Round Edges in Storage Box, Plastic, 7 Piece 9 x 12 x 16 cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M1R7v5ImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description No baker's toolkit would be complete without a good set of reliable baking cutters. Ideally, you want a set that never lets you down and comes into its own when you're baking all the classic biscuits, cakes and pastries. KitchenCraft's take on this essential baking tool definitely fits the bill! This set includes seven round cookie cutters, ranging from 38 mm to 98 mm in size. What sets the cutters apart from others is their double edge design. Each pastry cutter has a plain round edge, which is ideal for cutting biscuits, cookies and jam tart cases. Then flip them over and - voila! - you have a fluted cookie cutter, so you can give your scones, canapés and tartlet cases a fancy flourish. They're great value and very versatile, meaning they're sure to become a favourite in your baking repertoire. With their reinforced nylon structures, you can rely on them to last too - these double sided pastry cutters are designed to take quite a bashing. You don't have to worry about losing them either. Simply nest them inside one another and store them away in their handy plastic storage container. Set Contains: 7 x Cutters 7 x Cutters 1 x Storage Container 1 x Storage Container","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M1R7v5ImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Craft","source_asin":"B078RZB6BY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078RZB6BY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078RZB6BY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
