window.products.push({"id":935178,"name":"Space Heater for Indoor Use,Feculs Portable Heater with Digital Thermostat&Remote,1500W Fast Heating PTC Ceramic Electric Heater,1-12h Timer,90deg Qui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511vB7wMkJL._AC_.jpg","description":"2S Fast Heating, Instant Warmth: When winter comes around, a portable heater may be the answer to all your cold-weather issues. Adopting forceful PTC ceramic heating technology and high-speed fan DC motor, this space heater gives off surprisingly powerful heat to warm up 200 square feet room in seconds. Perfect heaters for indoor use can heat up any space faster and distribute the heat more evenly, keeping you cozy and warm in living room, bedroom or office. Personalized Warmth Comfort: The electric heater contains a fan-only mode and 3 heating options (high, low, and eco adaptive mode with an adjustable thermostat for controlling temperature levels.) Heaters indoor portable electric offers 3 heating modes ranging between 900 watts to 1500 watts in terms of output capacity. With a built-in precise temperature sensor, ECO mode automatically helps energy-saving based on the real-time temperature while keeping room at a constant temperature. Energy-efficient: You can switch to the energy-saving ECO mode and let the sensitive temperature control system of the heater monitor the surrounding air temperature. The adjustable temperature range is from 41°F to 95°F (in 1°F Increments). It will get the heater to cycle on and off heating according to if the room’s temperature reaches heater's setting temperature. Note: The display temperature is ambient temp around the heater, not the temp of the air coming out of the heater. Usage Comfort: 90° Widespread Oscillation helps heat cover every corner of your room. Small space heater is easy to move around with a hidden carrying handle on the back. The room heater works with a noise level down to 40dB, quiet enough for indoor sleeping, reading, and working. It has a touchscreen UI on top for easy touch control, and with a digital display at the front, you can check the status of the desk heater. Remote control offers you maximum convenience in cold winter. Multiple Safety Features: Space heaters for indoor use is ETL-certified. Small heater with sensor will switch off when it reaches 122°F. 1-12h timer let you fall asleep to quiet, cozy warmth while conserving electricity. The space heater is made of V0-rated flame-retardant materials and features overheating protection and a tip-over switch to ensure safe use. Cool-to-touch exterior, reinforced prongs and fire-resistant materials makes this personal heater a must have in each household.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511vB7wMkJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feculs","source_asin":"B0B9WHDLC1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9WHDLC1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9WHDLC1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
