window.products.push({"id":935321,"name":"Bermuda Coastal Plastic Table Cover - Clear Vinyl Tablecloth, Protective Table Cloth Rectangular Table, Thick Outdoor Tablecloth, Plastic Tablecloth, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k6wtXeUUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our clear plastic table cover is made of very high quality skin and food safe materials so there is no need to worry about the table cover causing harm to you or your children! No food particles or juices will stick to the table cover, making it very easy to keep clean and wipe off with a towel or rag. At 2mm thick, this plastic table cover will protect your table from even the most aggressive of spills or messy eaters will not be able to cause damage to your table. With the thickness of this table cover, your table is also offered protection from knives, forks and other utensils. We designed our clear table cover to be non slip so it will not go sliding off the table during dinner, and also so plates & cups will not easily slide around and be knocked off of it during a meal or party. We made sure to use materials that will give off no funky odor to make sure you and your guests can comfortably enjoy a meal around your table. The last point I will make here is that you can cut this table cover to fit, so if your table is a bit too small based on the dimensions we have provided do not worry! Although it is heavy duty, you can cut it down to the correct size rather simply. We hope you love our plastic table cover and would love to hear your feedback!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k6wtXeUUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bermuda Coastal","source_asin":"B0989FHT71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989FHT71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989FHT71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":935322,"name":"Reusable Ice Cube, 60 Pack Plastic Ice Cubes for Drinks BPA Free, Colorful Refreezable Square Ice Cubes for Water Bottles, Whiskey, Vodka, Coffee, Coc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6132jNZrWBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【KEEP FULL OF FLAVOR FOR YOUR DRINKS】: Cool your drinks without diluting flavors, this reusable ice cube will keep full of flavor and fresh taste for your drinks. The liquid is wrapped in plastic, now you can enjoy your drink slowly without worrying about melting ice cubes that will dilute and water down your drink. 【REUSABLE AND CONVENIENT】: Never need to add water to the tray to make ice cubes again and again. Just put the reusable ice cube in the freezer then ready to use at all time. It can be used repeatedly and washable. After use, just wash, dry, and put back to the freezer for next time. 【SAFETY FOOD GRADE MATERIAL】: Our reusable plastic ice cubes are made of BPA free non-toxic plastic PE material and purified water. Harmless in case of any accidental breaks, leaks or damage. You can enjoy the wonderful drinks with these ice cubes in assured with your family and friends. 【MULTI-USE IDEAL ICE CUBES】: Put these cute & colorful ice cubes into your favorite drinks to make your drinks brighter and funny! Prefect for beer, whiskey, coffees, vodka, water, wine, juice, soda, highball, cocktail, hurricane glasses, cool bags, and more. Enjoy them at all kinds of parties, bars, restaurants, pool, travel and so on. 【SMALL & PORTABLE】: Each package includes 60 packs reusable plastic ice cubes, each cube size is 1 x 1 x 1 Inch. perfect size for a cup or regular bottles. The ice cube is small and light, which is easy to carry in an insulated bag for outside parties or picnics. Enjoy iced drinks anytime & anywhere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6132jNZrWBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYTTME","source_asin":"B0BLHWQ8VF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHWQ8VF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHWQ8VF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
