window.products.push({"id":935486,"name":"NOVICA Decorative Steel Wall Mural, Blue, Shy Mermaid'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818RP4TOwvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Surrounded by sea bubbles, a shy mermaid comes to life in a sculpture by Alejandro de Esesarte. He works in steel to shape the lovely creature, hammering the piece into low relief and painting it by hand. Because each piece is individually handcrafted and painted, size and color could vary slightly. About our Artist: 'From the time I was a boy, I was attracted to art,' recalls Alejandro de Esesarte. 'When I was 20, I became an ecologist and defender of nature, and this is when I began to create animals in metal. My technique is similar to cutout metal, but more rudimentary. From this, I became inspired and started working in metal for its versatility. Today I have a workshop, a cockatoo named Coco and a cactus collection. Those are all the tools I need to continue working.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818RP4TOwvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01KKKZNO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KKKZNO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KKKZNO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
