window.products.push({"id":935696,"name":"Boho Floral Iced Coffee Glass Cup with Bamboo Lid and Straw | 16oz Beer Can Glass with Lids and Straw | Can Shaped Glass Soda Can Cup | Glass Tumbler ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iNfuJe2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Includes - One 16-ounce glass can cup (3\" diameter x 5.25\" height) with bamboo lid and stainless steel straw. These cute glass cups with bamboo lids not only creates a modern aesthetic, they also allow you to take your coffee, tea or other beverage on the run with you and prevents any spillage. The bamboo lids for beer can glass includes a snug-fitting silicone sleeve, which seals the iced coffee glasses and prevents leaks or splashes. High Quality Printing - \"Boho Floral\" aesthetic cups logo design is professionally printed on this iced coffee cup, it is NOT a sticker or vinyl! This prevents any fading or peeling of the design on the can glass. These cute cups with lid and straw are the best tumblers for women! Designed with a boho aesthetic in mind, these can shaped glass cups can be used to hold up to 16oz of all your favorite beverages, including iced coffee, tea, beer, wine, soda, water - you name it! The geometric wildflower logo makes them the perfect boho coffee tumbler for women! Care Instructions - We recommend hand washing only to preserve the design on your glass tumbler with bamboo lid and straw. We carefully pack each coffee cup in a sturdy, black gift box to ensure safe delivery to its destination. Enjoy the outdoors with your glass iced coffee cups! Ready For Gift Giving - Our flower cups come ready for gifting in a secure, presentable gift box. These glass beer can cups with lids make the perfect gifts for women or outdoor lovers in your life! Local - Thank you for supporting a family-run business out of Northern California – we truly appreciate your support! Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions or concerns, we want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iNfuJe2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron & Flint","source_asin":"B09TV2ZBH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TV2ZBH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TV2ZBH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":935697,"name":"AleHorn Viking Horn Mug - Handcrafted Tankard Drinking Cup for Beer and Coffee - Viking Decor - Wood Bottom - 24 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m9EcuVAuL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"GENUINE OX HORN: Every Viking horn is made of authentic, ethically sourced ox horn and chosen for its appearance, durability, color pattern, and shape. Each inspired tankard is a unique piece in itself. HANDCRAFTED WITH CARE: The secret ingredient of a finely crafted drinking horn is the care that goes into it. Each of our mugs is hand-selected, cut, and polished to near-perfection by generational artisans and features a quality wood or resin base. AWESOME GIFT: Give a gift that will be cherished for years. An Alehorn drinking horn makes a great gift for bachelor parties, Father's Day, birthdays, and more. Whatever the occasion, it will quickly become your giftee's new favorite mug. ETHICALLY SOURCED: We are just as concerned with animal cruelty as you are, so we've made sure our horns come from a family farm that raises the oxen primarily for meat, with specialization and history in horn crafting. ALEHORN: We are proud to produce only the highest-quality, 100% horn tankards. Each of our hand-crafted pieces is different with its own unique story and character, but what unites them all is our stellar team dedicated to the highest standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m9EcuVAuL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AleHorn","source_asin":"B0BB84R33R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-935697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB84R33R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB84R33R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
